    "Tafsir Kemenag RI (quran.kemenag.go.id) — Surah Al-An'am",
    "Al-Itqan fi 'Ulum al-Qur'an, As-Suyuthi",
    "Asbab an-Nuzul, Al-Wahidi — Surah Al-An'am",
